  "solution": {
    "text": "We know that,<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> in cyclic process<br />So <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></math><br />We know,<br />work done = Area under P-V curve<br />= Area of circle<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>20</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>400</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mtext>J</mtext></math><br />So Heat energy absorbed<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>",
